        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "A drum machine you can open up. Press Space to play.\n\nThe Drum Machine block plays a sixteen-step pattern in time with the transport: a Clock inside steps through a Pattern and each row fires a synthesized drum. It also sends out one trigger per drum, and here those triggers play a second kit of Samplers cut from one audio file. Click the Sampled kit switch to hear the same pattern on either kit."
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            0.0,
            -264.0
          ],
          "size": [
            700.0,
            128.0
          ]
        }
      },
